-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  dir_err_directives_lib.adam - Break step of build directives (AUD4 5.8):
  @addverinfo on in a lib is the warning SM0103 and is not applied (a lib is
  no file the OS runs); @subsystem console is taken; @unitTestMode, even
  off, is SM0110 (a lib runs no tests, as pcpp); @addverinfo given again is
  SM0102
*******************************************************************************/

/*
@@test
  kind error
@@end
*/

module lib dir_err_directives_lib;

@addverinfo on; // WARN SM0103@1
@subsystem console;
@unitTestMode off; // ERROR SM0110@1
@addverinfo off; // ERROR SM0102@1

end.
